{"name":"Tatami","hex":"#deccaf","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"tatami","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Straw matting, in a standard size, used as a floor covering in Japanese houses.","A unit of area equal to a standard-sized tatami mat, approximately 1.65 square metres."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tatami"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tatami","blocks":[{"text":"Tatami (畳) are soft mats used as flooring material in traditional Japanese-style rooms. They are made in standard sizes, twice as long as wide, about 0.9 by 1.8 metres, depending on the region. In martial arts, tatami are used for training in a dojo and for competition."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/Enk%C5%8D-ji%2C_Kyoto_Inside.jpg/330px-Enk%C5%8D-ji%2C_Kyoto_Inside.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tatami"},{"title":"Tatami (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Tatami is a 2023 sports drama thriller film directed by Guy Nattiv and Zar Amir Ebrahimi, from a screenplay by Nattiv and Elham Erfani. It stars Arienne Mandi, Ebrahimi, Jaime Ray Newman, Ash Goldeh and Sina Parvaneh."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/18/Tatami%2C_directed_by_Guy_Nattiv_and_Zar_Amir_Ebrahimi.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tatami_(film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Modern_tatami.JPG/330px-Modern_tatami.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Modern_tatami.JPG/960px-Modern_tatami.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Modern_tatami.JPG/330px-Modern_tatami.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbn